1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:03,320
Vaqtni sotib olib bo'lmaydi.

2
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:07,120
Lekin sen uni har kuni sotasan.

3
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:10,890
Bobo, osh tayyor.

4
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:13,200
Keyin, bolam.

5
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:14,260
Keyin.

6
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:23,340
Qo'rqma.

7
00:00:23,780 --> 00:00:25,410
Olib ketgani kelmadim.

8
00:00:25,850 --> 00:00:28,100
Hisobingni ko'rsatgani keldim.

9
00:00:28,660 --> 00:00:32,130
O'tgan yillarimni qaytar, hamma oltinimni ol!

10
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:39,200
O'tgan vaqt sotilmaydi.

11
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:42,610
Umr faqat Allohning qo'lida.

12
00:00:43,050 --> 00:00:44,700
Men faqat ko'rsataman.

13
00:01:20,360 --> 00:01:22,020
O'ttiz yil.

14
00:01:22,860 --> 00:01:24,540
Bittasini qaytar...

15
00:01:25,060 --> 00:01:27,460
O'tganini hech kim qaytarolmaydi.

16
00:01:27,900 --> 00:01:30,690
Qancha qolganini faqat Alloh biladi.

17
00:01:31,130 --> 00:01:35,140
Lekin bugun va hozir hali seniki.

18
00:01:36,360 --> 00:01:38,800
Bobo, osh sovib qoldi.

19
00:01:39,460 --> 00:01:40,510
Hozir, bolam!

20
00:01:40,570 --> 00:01:41,300
Hozir!

21
00:01:52,360 --> 00:01:54,400
O'tgan vaqt qaytmaydi.

22
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:58,030
Shuning uchun — bugun va hozir.

23
00:02:02,860 --> 00:02:05,480
Bobo, bugungi AI maslahati!

24
00:02:05,960 --> 00:02:09,000
Vaqtingizni bekorga ketkazmang.

25
00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:12,560
Har kuni bitta yangi narsa o'rganing.

26
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:17,020
Har tong kanalimizda bepul AI maslahati,

27
00:02:17,390 --> 00:02:20,330
savolingizni esa botimizga yozing.

